  "schema:comment": "The openEHR Clinical Knowledge Manager (CKM) at https://ckm.openehr.org warrants a separate MACH entry under data-models-research as a curated archetype library. EHRbase (https://github.com/ehrbase/ehrbase), the leading open-source openEHR CDR, also warrants a separate entry under clinical-systems.",
